id: busy-script-stop
section: Sites
item: jihad-busy.html: the "script may be busy" dialog comes up (about 60 s in); the frame is kept, its Cancel (Stop script) tapped: the card comes back and stays usable (a tap on the page reaches the engine)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-modern-web.md R2
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
inject url http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-busy.html
expect dialog present 90
shoot busy-dialog
chrome dialog-cancel
expect dialog answered 10
wait rect 'sel:h1' 20
tap 'sel:h1'
expect hit 'sel:h1'
